01:02:22.360 --> 01:02:27.360
 If they're unable or unwilling to do that, then certainly we ought to look at what it's going to take for us to take care of it.

01:02:27.360 --> 01:02:29.360
 Yeah, I agree.

01:02:29.360 --> 01:02:36.360
