 one nation under God, indivisible, with liberty and justice for all. All right, first up, we have a public hearing, an ordinance of Eagle Mountain City, Utah, amending the Eagle Mountain Municipal Code, Chapter 15.95, International Code, and 16.60, Building Permits.

